tree(第2/5/15 修订,新增第16)\n\n用户两条深修正:\n- 对错机器判,不需要人当仲裁。第2条重写:对错(忠实/空洞/矛盾)由形式验证(Lean kernel)+多模型对抗(sshx+异模型)机器判——先例 O6空洞/O5错误/候选B忠实全是机器判出的;真⊋证的 Gödel 边界对谁都不可判(人也判不了),诚实标 open 而非\"等人裁决\";Hearts 两 sorry 是边界标记不是待人裁决的悬案。人类门不判对错,只授权不可逆动作+做价值选择。\n- 第5条:会不会说谎机器也能判;门设在不可逆授权处,非\"机器判不了对错\"处。\n- 第15条:删去\"机器判不了的语义真值/审美\"这一门(对错机器已判);门收敛为①不可逆授权②价值选择,均非判对错;不设\"等人判对错\"的门。\n- 新增第16条:代码实施与大改走独立 git worktree(各自分支+PR),并行推进,主干保持可发布;并行安全由 GID地址算出+分支锁+required-check+SL-022 机器保证。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpX7YuThNHL6TFkgrYip2n","tree":{"sha":"fc0aaf51bd644f35a131fad87001ac4805ed0dd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/git/trees/fc0aaf51bd644f35a131fad87001ac4805ed0dd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/git/commits/d7af67136d4478875778ac6e75eb5fbb8b3693a5","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/commits/d7af67136d4478875778ac6e75eb5fbb8b3693a5","html_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/commit/d7af67136d4478875778ac6e75eb5fbb8b3693a5","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/commits/d7af67136d4478875778ac6e75eb5fbb8b3693a5/comments","author":{"login":"loning","id":1593871,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1OTM4NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1593871?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loning","html_url":"https://github.com/loning","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loning/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loning/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loning/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loning/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loning/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https: